@startuml ''

title Event Storming — поток ключевых событий между доменами

' Участники (домены и подписчики)
participant "Identity & Access" as IA
participant "Patient Management" as PM
participant "Clinical Services" as CL
participant "AI Diagnostics" as AI
participant "Pharma Partners" as PH
participant "Financial Services" as FS
participant "Reporting & BI" as RB
participant "Notification Hub" as NH
participant "DLQ" as DLQ

' События и их последовательность (порядок условный)
IA -> PM: UserCreated
IA -> FS: UserOnboarded
PM -> CL: PatientRegistered
PM -> CL: ConsentChanged
PM -> RB: DemographicUpdated
CL -> AI: StudyRequested
AI -> CL: DiagnosisReady
AI -> DLQ: PredictionFailed (при ошибке)
PH -> CL: DrugRecalled
CL -> FS: ServiceProvided
FS -> RB: TransactionCompleted
FS -> NH: PaymentOverdue

' Примечания
note right of DLQ
  Обработка несбойных
  и ошибочных событий
end note
@enduml